Pushing a new line to this file fires .github/workflows/daily.yml through
its `push` trigger. It exists only because the GitHub App connected to
this repo has "contents: write" but not "actions: write" — a plain commit
here is what a workflow_dispatch call would otherwise be used for. See the
comment at the top of daily.yml for the full reason.

